{
 "_source": "Hand-transcribed 7 August 2026, speed and latency columns re-read later the same day after the AA board updated them from three public leaderboards supplied by the site owner: LMArena (leaderboard overview), Artificial Analysis (LLM leaderboard), and LiveBench release 2026-06-25. Raw published figures only. Roster is every model appearing on BOTH LiveBench and Artificial Analysis, rather than every model that also happened to be in the Arena export: Arena membership was gating the roster while Arena figures are the weakest separators on the board. null means the board printed no value for that model, and it stays null rather than being back-filled from a sibling tier.",
 "_note_arena_signals": "The four Agent Arena session signals (confirmed, praise, steer, bash) are NOT in this file. The LMArena export carries only the Agent board's Net Improvement column, which model-picker deliberately refuses to import because its own rank is built from it. Those four metrics still come from data/arena-agent.json, last read 1 August 2026.",
